# Never commit key material. A Tailscale TLS keypair reached the repo once.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.crt
*.cer
*.mobileprovision

# Worktrees. .boss/ is also added to .git/info/exclude when worktrees are set
# to live in the project; this covers a clone that never enabled that, and
# .claude/ for the worktrees Claude Code makes with its own EnterWorktree.
.boss/
.claude/worktrees/
